cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Petaling WWTP Effluent Monitoring & GHG Emission Intensities Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Final-effluent lab monitoring results (BOD, COD, NH3-N, NO3-N, pH, oil & grease,
  TSS, temperature, EQA 2009 compliance) for the PETALING-MAWAR (PTG248) sewage
  treatment plant, 2023-2025, with derived CH4 and N2O greenhouse-gas emission
  intensities (kg CO2-eq/m3).
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-26"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/JienWeng/wwtp-dashboard"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JienWeng/wwtp-dashboard"
keywords:
  - wastewater treatment
  - effluent quality
  - greenhouse gas emissions
  - water quality monitoring
  - EQA 2009
authors:
  - family-names: Lai
    given-names: Jien Weng
    affiliation: "Monash University Malaysia"
  - family-names: Chow
    given-names: Ming Fai
    affiliation: "Monash University Malaysia"
